{{!-- =====================================================
     SASHA HOMEPAGE CAPABILITIES
====================================================== --}}

<section
  class="sasha-home-learning"
  aria-labelledby="sasha-home-learning-heading"
>

  <header class="sasha-home-learning-heading">

    <p class="sasha-home-learning-eyebrow">
      More than proposal writing
    </p>

    <h2 id="sasha-home-learning-heading">
      Sasha can do more than write
    </h2>

  </header>


  <div class="sasha-home-learning-grid">

    {{!-- =================================================
         READ THE RFP
    ================================================== --}}

    <article class="sasha-home-learning-card">

      <p
        class="sasha-home-learning-number"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        01
      </p>

      <h3>
        READ THE RFP
      </h3>

      <p class="sasha-home-learning-tagline">
        Find every requirement that matters.
      </p>

      <p class="sasha-home-learning-description">
        Sasha can turn a long RFP into a working brief by identifying
        submission requirements, evaluation criteria, mandatory
        requirements, key dates, requested services, deliverables,
        and potential risks.
      </p>

    </article>


    {{!-- =================================================
         FIND THE EVIDENCE
    ================================================== --}}

    <article class="sasha-home-learning-card">

      <p
        class="sasha-home-learning-number"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        02
      </p>

      <h3>
        FIND THE EVIDENCE
      </h3>

      <p class="sasha-home-learning-tagline">
        Connect your response to the experience behind it.
      </p>

      <p class="sasha-home-learning-description">
        Sasha can draw on project experience, resumes, past proposal
        material, organizational resources, and pursuit information
        to find credible evidence that supports your response.
      </p>

    </article>


    {{!-- =================================================
         REVIEW AGAINST THE RFP
    ================================================== --}}

    <article class="sasha-home-learning-card">

      <p
        class="sasha-home-learning-number"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        03
      </p>

      <h3>
        REVIEW AGAINST THE RFP
      </h3>

      <p class="sasha-home-learning-tagline">
        See what you've missed before the client does.
      </p>

      <p class="sasha-home-learning-description">
        Sasha can compare a draft against the client's requirements
        and evaluation criteria, identify missing or weak responses,
        flag unsupported claims, and show where the proposal is not
        answering what the client actually asked.
      </p>

    </article>

  </div>

</section>